  "description": "*\"Let's make the best chicken ever!!!\"*\n\nSang-Uk's father took all his severance pay and invested it into a chicken restaurant. However, within a few days of opening, his father had an accident, and suddenly running the store became Sang-Uk's responsibility, although he was a mere college student.... \n\nThe taste of Sang-Uk's chicken, which he made for the first time in his life, is terrible! He tries his best to continue running the store, but he can't see a future for it...And therefore Sang-Uk is forced to ask for help from his greatest enemy, Hye-Ri, to help him find the best fried chicken recipe! Will he succeed?\n\n(Source: Manyeo Comics, translated and edited)",
